* SPICE Netlist
V1 3 4 AC 1 ; AC Voltage Source from node 3 to node 4
RS 3 2 1k ; Resistor RS between node 3 and node 2
RL 2 5 1k ; Resistor RL between node 2 and node 5
D1 2 2 Dmodel ; Diode D1 from node 2 to node 2
D2 2 2 Dmodel ; Diode D2 from node 2 to node 2

.model Dmodel D (IS=1e-14)  ; Diode model definition